  "selection": "All 48 selected pinned project files, including sources, headers, Makefile and original BMP assets, are unchanged. Unrelated labs, generated objects, documentation and VCS metadata outside the selected project were omitted.",
  "controlsRationale": "Relative pointer starts at the original mouse_state (0, 0), with unit deltas and an 800 × 600 menu. No direct or calibrated pointer preset is enabled. The WASD pad steers the car and penguin, or moves and turns the raycast view. Select / Spawn sends the original left mouse button; Clear Marks sends the right button. P pauses globally, Escape returns to the original menu, and 1/2/3 select raycast maps. Auto orientation keeps the 4:3 canvas and panel controls usable in portrait. The original omits F4, so build.environment explicitly selects the existing documented LCOM_COMPAT_MOUSE_REPORTING=1 persistent Minix VM state. The explicit /home/lcom/labs/proj → proj alias preserves original POSIX open/pread bitmap paths through the shared SDK.",
